      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Perhaps also add a checkbox to choose whether the trigger should fire only if the video start/ends naturally, or also if it ends because of a stop/next trigger.\n\nAs there can be situations where you want something to happen only at the end of the video, and not when the track is skipped or stopped, and likewise when you actually want that to also happen on stop/next etc.\n\nAlso consider adding that to the current OnVideoEnd/Play triggers.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-06-21T04:38:43.921Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A new trigger for when a specific index in the video sync component starts/ends\n\n- OnVideoIndexPlay\n- OnVideoIndexEnd\n\n\nThis could allow for better interaction in the world, with like clubs doing different light animations that match the video. \nCreate looped playlist with a large videosync list (0-9 then back to 0. 10-19 then back to 10)\nMuch more that could be done with this.\n\n#####\n\nOnVideoIndexEnd\n- index: 9\n- receiver: video panel\n- - playindex: 0",
